    <briefdescription>
<para>Image data created from <ref refid="classcuvis_1_1ViewExporter" kindref="compound">ViewExporter</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The ViewExpoter generates image views (int 8 bit resolution) and data views (in floating point precision). Each image is named by it&apos;s <ref refid="structcuvis_1_1view__t_1a40bb9e88ccc9763f50dcce9717faa4f3" kindref="member">_id</ref>. Also the <ref refid="structcuvis_1_1view__t_1a05c0bea8e7473be929bd9ad993181414" kindref="member">_show</ref> flag is set with respect to the setting of the view&apos;s author. See <ref refid="classcuvis_1_1ViewExporter" kindref="compound">ViewExporter</ref> for more information. See <ref refid="structcuvis_1_1common__image__t" kindref="compound">common_image_t</ref> for single pixel access.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>data_t</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The pixel bit depth, either std::uint8_t or float </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
